Package: kulan-fleet-admin
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), gir1.2-secret-1
Recommends: kulan-desktop-settings
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ fleet dashboard for administrators
 Kulan Fleet: see the computers that joined your organisation (Kulan OS
 version, compliance results, waiting updates, TPM unlock), make join codes
 and ask computers to report, install updates, turn compliance mode on,
 lock the screen or restart. Only accounts on the fleet's admin list see
 anything; not installed by default.
